Package: ggsaveR
Title: A Wrapper for 'ggplot2::ggsave' with Extra Features
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Anders Hagen", "Jarmund", , "anders.h.jarmund@ntnu.no", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A drop-in replacement for 'ggsave()' from 'ggplot2', configured
    through global options so that existing scripts need no changes. Saves
    plots to several formats and sizes at once, embeds the plot object, data
    and call in PNG files for reproducibility, and protects existing files
    from being overwritten.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    ggplot2
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://andjar.github.io/ggsaveR/, https://github.com/andjar/ggsaveR
BugReports: https://github.com/andjar/ggsaveR/issues
